p/2943670?t=1761136371","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943670/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761136371","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943670/1697e929e12dc29e1a94dd0d63d202885edc6bcc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761136371","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943670/1697e929e12dc29e1a94dd0d63d202885edc6bcc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761136371","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game includes alcohol consumption, party-themed environments, and occasional violence. Players can serve beer and cocktails in a nightclub setting and may physically remove unruly guests through force. There are light references to fictional party pills and mushrooms (non-realistic and stylized). The game also contains strong language, adult humor, and mature themes."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take over a run-down, abandoned venue and transform it into the most popular nightclub in the country. In this adventure, players will renovate, upgrade, and expand every corner of the space to reach the pinnacle of nightlife. But it won't be easy; you'll need to manage troublesome customers while also maintaining the club's reputation. This game isn't just a nightclub simulator; it's a journey of strategy, creativity, and chaos that you\u2019ll experience together with your friends. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From venue design to customer relationships, we provide a dynamic atmosphere that immerses you in the chaos and excitement of nightlife. Create your own club\u2019s style and atmosphere, customize your venue, and leave your mark on the nightlife scene. Whether you want to deck out your club with a modern design or add a touch of nostalgia, the choice is entirely yours! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943670/extras/0665c45ec6ecad5c2ce9d32b1b0c0ecf.webp?t=1761136371\" width=174 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The best graphics in the co-op simulation genre you'll ever play. Developed with Unreal Engine 5.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943670/extras/539faac9578832bce0bd5188d9c54bfb.poster.avif?t=1761136371\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943670/extras/539faac9578832bce0bd5188d9c54bfb.webm?t=1761136371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943670/extras/539faac9578832bce0bd5188d9c54bfb.mp4?t=1761136371\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943670/extras/4aaa3ffbd3807821cae686b35545c5a9.webp?t=1761136371\" width=347 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic customer AI behaviors and spontaneous events for a more immersive experience.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943670/extras/81bd0deb40ef3096cdd511759e60923d.poster.avif?t=1761136371\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_